  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong><span>警告：部分生物不會消失，您必須使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-despawn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Despawn Tweaks</a> 進行設定！</span></strong></span></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span>寄生怪物現已生成於失落之城。擊殺寄生生物時，有低機率掉落戒指。</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span>推薦模組版本</span></h3>\n<div>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epca/files/8014299\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">End-Parasitize and Convert All</a> [&nbsp; 0.3.4+ ]</h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities/files/all?page=2&pageSize=20&version=1.20.1&showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Lost Cities</a> [ 7.2.0 ]</span></h1>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lost-cities-addon-biome-fixer/files/5990956\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lost Cities Addon: Biome Fixer</a> [ 1.0.2+ ]</h1>\n<h1><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets-and-baubles-reforked/files/6939129\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trinkets and Baubles Reforked</a> [ 1.3.1+ ]</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
